# Rycharde the Chef (otherAreas 0): 70's accepting option and a finish out of its state. Prog 2 (a GM): Rycharde's 70,
# option 71: begun (Prog stays 2). Accepted: two meat: 74; the quest made available again by a GM while 74 is open: no
# 74 handler in the available section (nothing given, the meat kept).
lists Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrigger Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrade Mhaura/onEventFinish/70 Mhaura/onEventFinish/74
char zone=Mhaura pos=18.9,-16,88.8 job=WAR lvl=30
item SliceOfDhalmelMeat x2
charvar Quest[4][0]Prog 2
login
trigger Rycharde                        # Prog 2: 70 (4359)
finish option=71                        # begun
trigger Rycharde                        # accepted: 72
finish
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x2    # 74
quest OtherAreas.RychardeTheChef available # a GM, while 74 is open
finish                                  # no 74 handler while available: nothing (the meat kept, no reward)
